1
00:00:14,120 --> 00:00:18,420
Aiming for the setting sun
floating over the Nakagawa,

2
00:00:18,420 --> 00:00:23,580
I kicked a pebble,
sending it flying as far as it would go.

3
00:00:24,140 --> 00:00:29,420
To the gym class head I was talking with,

4
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,820
they laughed that I was
still so full of energy.

5
00:00:33,820 --> 00:00:37,440
Even if I stir up some
good energy somewhere,

6
00:00:37,440 --> 00:00:38,680
there's only one way: to win.

7
00:00:38,680 --> 00:00:41,940
A nightmare, and the unchanging streetscape

8
00:00:41,940 --> 00:00:43,880
is gentler than that.

9
00:00:44,560 --> 00:00:46,860
Because the crows are crying,

10
00:00:46,860 --> 00:00:48,700
the sun has already gone down.

11
00:00:49,800 --> 00:00:51,940
Yakitori Hobari

12
00:00:51,940 --> 00:00:53,840
Even looking at it...

13
00:00:54,660 --> 00:00:57,500
Of the acorn-cap

14
00:00:57,500 --> 00:01:04,080
The sun sets from the
waterworks toward Oishiden

15
00:01:06,740 --> 00:01:10,100
Tomorrow, too,
it all ends in a fall, doesn't it?

16
00:01:10,100 --> 00:01:13,660
Katsushika, happiness lost for a while, too

17
00:01:13,660 --> 00:01:16,300
Because I've only just come to my senses,
that's me

18
00:01:25,200 --> 00:01:27,860
Love Warrior, Territory, Kankichi

19
00:01:31,200 --> 00:01:35,040
Yes! After a month's work,
it's finally finished!

20
00:01:35,440 --> 00:01:38,200
The original handmade plastic
model of the battleship Nagato, too

21
00:01:38,200 --> 00:01:41,060
If I do say so myself,
it's a masterpiece that leaves me dazzled!

22
00:01:41,060 --> 00:01:41,300
Whew!

23
00:01:45,540 --> 00:01:48,340
I pulled an all-nighter
for three days to finish it

24
00:01:48,920 --> 00:01:50,240
I've reached my limit

25
00:02:06,460 --> 00:02:08,720
Master, please pull yourself together.

26
00:02:08,720 --> 00:02:12,160
The time has finally come.

27
00:02:13,300 --> 00:02:16,180
My life will last one week at most.

28
00:02:17,240 --> 00:02:21,080
In that time, I must choose a
successor for our Hondara Prefecture.

29
00:02:23,120 --> 00:02:27,540
By rights, my eldest children,
Asa and Ai, should inherit it,

30
00:02:27,540 --> 00:02:32,400
but, lamentably, Ai has become infatuated
with a man named Kankichi Ryotsu

31
00:02:32,820 --> 00:02:35,980
and has lost all desire to
inherit Hondara Prefecture.

32
00:02:37,300 --> 00:02:39,040
But from what I have seen,

33
00:02:39,520 --> 00:02:43,320
that Kankichi Ryotsu is quite capable.

34
00:02:43,920 --> 00:02:47,940
Perhaps as the successor to the master
of Hondara Prefecture's secret teachings,

35
00:02:47,940 --> 00:02:49,520
he may be suitable.

36
00:02:50,580 --> 00:02:52,660
I want to see it with my own eyes.

37
00:02:53,120 --> 00:02:56,380
Recall the Hontara Four Heavenly
Kings from their training.

38
00:02:56,380 --> 00:02:58,200
Why the Four Heavenly Kings?

39
00:02:58,200 --> 00:03:01,620
to see if he's worthy to be the
successor of the Hontara school.

40
00:03:02,240 --> 00:03:05,360
We'll have Kankichi Ryotsu
fight the Four Heavenly Kings.

41
00:03:05,980 --> 00:03:07,760
But how?

42
00:03:08,880 --> 00:03:09,960
I have a plan.

43
00:03:09,960 --> 00:03:11,760
Come closer and lend me your ear.

44
00:03:11,760 --> 00:03:13,500
Because he's so feminine.

45
00:03:13,500 --> 00:03:14,500
What kind of...

46
00:03:14,500 --> 00:03:16,700
Even more so.

47
00:03:19,220 --> 00:03:20,600
The pain's coming back again.

48
00:03:21,960 --> 00:03:24,160
We must hurry.

49
00:03:36,640 --> 00:03:39,821
Ah ah ah ah ah ah

50
00:03:39,871 --> 00:03:43,350
Ah ah ah ah ah ah ah,

51
00:03:43,400 --> 00:03:46,856
Ah ah ah ah ah ah ah,

52
00:03:46,906 --> 00:03:50,411
Ah ah ah ah ah ah ah,

53
00:03:50,461 --> 00:03:53,904
Ah ah ah ah ah ah ah,

54
00:03:53,954 --> 00:03:57,447
Ah ah ah ah ah ah ah,

55
00:03:57,497 --> 00:04:00,966
Ah ah ah ah ah ah ah,

56
00:04:01,016 --> 00:04:04,660
Ah ah ah ah ah ah ah

57
00:04:06,360 --> 00:04:07,540
Atashijō?

58
00:04:10,680 --> 00:04:12,267
Ryotsu Kankichi-dono,

59
00:04:12,317 --> 00:04:15,443
Your most precious model,
after your very life,

60
00:04:15,493 --> 00:04:17,600
has been taken by Asa and Ban.

61
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:21,725
If you want it back,
be here by 9:59 tomorrow morning,

62
00:04:21,775 --> 00:04:25,400
to Mount Hondara,
the sacred ground of my Honden-ken.

63
00:04:25,920 --> 00:04:29,380
The Four Heavenly Kings of
Honden-ken are waiting for you.

64
00:04:29,720 --> 00:04:32,980
I shall thoroughly judge the
extent of your true ability.

65
00:04:32,980 --> 00:04:36,040
GAAH! GAAH! GAAH! GAAH! GAAH! KOKEKOKKOO!

66
00:04:36,260 --> 00:04:38,760
Honden-ken Grand Master: Asa and Ban!

67
00:04:39,340 --> 00:04:41,320
Damn it! What grudge could
they possibly have against me?!

68
00:04:41,680 --> 00:04:45,000
The crystallization of a month's blood,
sweat, and my entire fortune!

69
00:04:45,560 --> 00:04:48,060
Anyway, I can't forgive this! Honden-ken!

70
00:04:49,700 --> 00:04:50,940
What did you say?!

71
00:04:51,640 --> 00:04:54,860
The Honden-ken Four Heavenly Kings
and Ryo-sama are going to duel?!

72
00:04:54,860 --> 00:04:56,420
The Honden-ken Four Heavenly Kings?

73
00:04:56,780 --> 00:05:00,380
They're the ones my father sent
across the country on warrior training.

74
00:05:00,720 --> 00:05:03,180
They're all said to be a match for me.

75
00:05:03,860 --> 00:05:06,580
Still, giving us until
9:59 tomorrow morning...

76
00:05:06,580 --> 00:05:08,760
That's a really awkward time to set.

77
00:05:09,280 --> 00:05:11,420
If you don't punch your time card by then,

78
00:05:11,420 --> 00:05:13,140
you'll be punished severely.

79
00:05:13,140 --> 00:05:16,000
You're just like a salaryman, aren't you.

80
00:05:16,620 --> 00:05:17,520
Never mind that.

81
00:05:17,520 --> 00:05:20,160
What's going to happen to my
model that they took hostage?

82
00:05:20,860 --> 00:05:22,800
If we're even one minute
late for the deadline,

83
00:05:22,800 --> 00:05:24,440
Father won't show any mercy.

84
00:05:24,780 --> 00:05:27,220
The model will probably be split in two.

85
00:05:27,220 --> 00:05:30,260
Aaargh, damn it!

86
00:05:31,620 --> 00:05:37,560
Or they'll rebuild him into some strange shape,
or make him play a game!

87
00:05:38,080 --> 00:05:45,440
Maria-sama, Maria, help me!
Where, where is that Mount Hondara?

88
00:05:46,680 --> 00:05:54,560
Could it be that in Ryo-sama's clear eyes, what's there is my...
Please, Maria!

89
00:05:54,560 --> 00:05:55,320
Yes.

90
00:05:56,340 --> 00:05:59,960
But why would Senpai face off
against the Four Heavenly Kings?

91
00:05:59,960 --> 00:06:02,060
I'd like to know that myself!

92
00:06:02,060 --> 00:06:03,920
Of course, it's a trial.

93
00:06:03,920 --> 00:06:04,780
Trial.

94
00:06:04,780 --> 00:06:07,280
What do you mean, a trial?

95
00:06:07,280 --> 00:06:10,780
Father wants to see whether
Ryo-sama is worthy to be my husband,

96
00:06:10,780 --> 00:06:13,460
so he's trying to have him
face the Four Heavenly Kings.

97
00:06:15,040 --> 00:06:19,900
But Maria, even if you look like a woman,
you're really a man, aren't you?

98
00:06:19,900 --> 00:06:24,220
No, whether man or woman,
love is unbeatable, my dear.

99
00:06:24,560 --> 00:06:25,731
Ryo-sama,

100
00:06:25,781 --> 00:06:28,873
please win for the sake
of your love for Maria.

101
00:06:28,923 --> 00:06:30,320
I beg you.

102
00:06:30,780 --> 00:06:34,460
But your opponents are all
powerhouses on Maria's level, right?

103
00:06:35,660 --> 00:06:38,517
No matter how strong the enemy,
there is one place that can't be trained,

104
00:06:38,567 --> 00:06:40,507
a weak point.

105
00:06:40,557 --> 00:06:42,700
If you strike there,
you have a chance to win.

106
00:06:43,680 --> 00:06:44,320
Weak point?

107
00:06:45,040 --> 00:06:48,160
Seppai, now that it's come to this,
there's no turning back.

108
00:06:48,620 --> 00:06:49,580
That's right.

109
00:06:49,630 --> 00:06:52,660
If you're a man,
you must answer Maria's love.

110
00:06:54,560 --> 00:06:55,120
He's a man!

111
00:06:55,500 --> 00:06:56,660
How passionate!

112
00:06:58,000 --> 00:07:01,640
Ryo-sama is going to
throw away his life for me!

113
00:07:01,740 --> 00:07:02,420
Calm down, calm down!

114
00:07:04,160 --> 00:07:05,220
Ryo-sama?

115
00:07:07,220 --> 00:07:10,580
You idiot!
I almost threw my life away right here!

116
00:07:10,980 --> 00:07:12,880
Sorry, I was so overcome with emotion...

117
00:07:12,880 --> 00:07:14,960
Anyway, let's go! Maria!

118
00:07:15,240 --> 00:07:16,140
Yes, Ryo-sama!

119
00:07:16,580 --> 00:07:19,660
To the holy land of Honden-ken,
Mount Hondara!

120
00:07:28,140 --> 00:07:29,720
That's Mount Hondara.

121
00:07:32,320 --> 00:07:35,960
At the summit of this mountain is the cave,
the holy site of Honden-ken.

122
00:07:35,960 --> 00:07:37,860
There's also Ahondara-dō.

123
00:07:46,400 --> 00:07:48,320
We've been waiting for you, Kankichi Ryotsu.

124
00:07:48,320 --> 00:07:51,160
You know my name, don't you?

125
00:07:51,720 --> 00:07:55,136
I am Chaplin, the Tragedy King,
one of the Four Heavenly Kings of Hondara.

126
00:07:55,186 --> 00:07:56,920
Chaplin, the Tragedy King.

127
00:07:56,920 --> 00:07:59,020
Chaplin is the King of Comedy, you idiot.

128
00:07:59,020 --> 00:08:01,020
Ryo-sama, leave this to me.

129
00:08:01,020 --> 00:08:04,057
Maria, stay back! You're the one,

130
00:08:04,107 --> 00:08:06,680
who took my model.

131
00:08:07,280 --> 00:08:09,254
I'm so happy, Ryo-sama.

132
00:08:09,304 --> 00:08:12,340
You'd take my place and stand in front of me,
wouldn't you?

133
00:08:12,340 --> 00:08:13,920
Come on, Tragedy King!

134
00:08:14,420 --> 00:08:15,880
Let's go, Ryotsu!

135
00:08:26,460 --> 00:08:28,400
Is he really that strong?

136
00:08:29,340 --> 00:08:30,620
You mustn't underestimate him.

137
00:08:30,620 --> 00:08:32,440
His deadly technique is...

138
00:08:34,220 --> 00:08:35,220
Here I come!

139
00:08:35,220 --> 00:08:36,880
Wailing Dog!

140
00:08:36,880 --> 00:08:38,940
Wailing Dog!

141
00:08:39,500 --> 00:08:41,720
That was back when I was in kindergarten.

142
00:08:42,300 --> 00:08:46,260
I set off carrying the rice
balls Mom had made for me.

143
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:48,700
But then...

144
00:08:49,220 --> 00:08:50,020
I...

145
00:08:50,560 --> 00:08:54,380
dropped one, and it rolled down the slope.

146
00:08:58,240 --> 00:09:00,520
That was back in elementary school.

147
00:09:00,960 --> 00:09:05,360
Even though my field trip was
cancelled because of the rain,

148
00:09:05,360 --> 00:09:09,240
I went and brought my
backpack to school anyway.

149
00:09:10,900 --> 00:09:14,780
At lunch, I spilled milk on
the sweater Mom knitted for me,

150
00:09:14,780 --> 00:09:17,040
soaking it completely.

151
00:09:17,040 --> 00:09:21,120
At the folk dance,
nobody would hold my hand.

152
00:09:21,120 --> 00:09:23,600
At a group date,
when I asked a girl for her phone number,

153
00:09:23,650 --> 00:09:26,180
she gave me a completely made-up one...

154
00:09:26,180 --> 00:09:28,540
I... I...

155
00:09:29,300 --> 00:09:35,220
What a miserable life!
I was born under such a sad, unlucky star!

156
00:09:38,300 --> 00:09:40,820
Whoa! He's crying!

157
00:09:41,700 --> 00:09:45,600
You're not crying, are you? Am I crying?!

158
00:09:45,880 --> 00:09:46,900
You're crying, aren't you!

159
00:09:47,220 --> 00:09:49,760
Be careful, Ryo-sama!
The wailing dog is coming!

160
00:10:10,780 --> 00:10:12,480
Go on and cry, you wimp!

161
00:10:12,620 --> 00:10:13,200
Mom!

162
00:10:16,180 --> 00:10:16,740
Waaah!

163
00:10:17,180 --> 00:10:18,080
That looks painful!

164
00:10:18,720 --> 00:10:21,900
Damn it, what on earth do I do...

165
00:10:26,280 --> 00:10:27,480
That's it!

166
00:10:28,180 --> 00:10:31,900
If crying makes him stronger,
then I'll just make him laugh!

167
00:10:32,400 --> 00:10:34,160
Waaah! Crying Fist!

168
00:10:34,160 --> 00:10:35,680
I've been defeated!

169
00:10:45,480 --> 00:10:48,060
Now's the time, Ryo-sama!
You strike the pressure points!

170
00:10:48,560 --> 00:10:49,260
Pressure points?

171
00:10:50,700 --> 00:10:54,400
They're the one spot no human can train!

172
00:10:54,840 --> 00:10:56,600
I see! That's it!

173
00:10:58,560 --> 00:11:01,980
Deadly technique: Section Chief Sword!

174
00:11:01,980 --> 00:11:13,460
Eeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeee

175
00:11:13,460 --> 00:11:14,680
Get to work, Ryo-sama!

176
00:11:15,520 --> 00:11:16,720
Never mind that, we have to hurry!

177
00:11:16,880 --> 00:11:20,820
At this rate, my model,
my model will fall to pieces!

178
00:11:22,880 --> 00:11:25,100
He's fighting for my sake,

179
00:11:25,120 --> 00:11:27,700
yet he keeps going on about his models
just to hide his embarrassment...

180
00:11:28,320 --> 00:11:29,720
Cute Ryo-sama!

181
00:11:35,680 --> 00:11:37,620
Has the King of Tragedy been defeated...?

182
00:11:38,740 --> 00:11:40,800
Just as expected of Kankichi Ryotsu...

183
00:11:48,140 --> 00:11:50,400
I've been waiting for you, Ryotsu Kankichi!

184
00:11:52,480 --> 00:11:55,560
What is this guy?
He's like some kind of special detective!

185
00:11:55,920 --> 00:11:59,900
One of the Four Heavenly Kings of Honden-ken,
Hōken-ō Danki!

186
00:12:00,680 --> 00:12:03,040
There used to be a manga
with a name like that.

187
00:12:03,040 --> 00:12:04,550
No, no!

188
00:12:04,600 --> 00:12:07,720
Mine are the stick of violence
and the sword of fists!

189
00:12:08,320 --> 00:12:13,000
You're a swordsman, yet using whips,
candles, and other weapons is cowardly!

190
00:12:13,460 --> 00:12:14,445
No, Ryū-sama.

191
00:12:14,495 --> 00:12:17,600
Those whips and candles are for
a different purpose altogether.

192
00:12:17,740 --> 00:12:18,940
Surely not.

193
00:12:19,360 --> 00:12:20,960
Ouch! Not yet!

194
00:12:21,340 --> 00:12:23,860
Ouch ouch ouch, no problem at all!

195
00:12:24,280 --> 00:12:25,800
More than different, he's a dangerous guy!

196
00:12:26,460 --> 00:12:28,780
By the way,
what's this guy's special technique?

197
00:12:29,520 --> 00:12:31,840
The Adventure King's special
technique is the Ōita Sword.

198
00:12:32,100 --> 00:12:35,500
After he hurts himself like
that and endures and endures,

199
00:12:35,620 --> 00:12:38,060
he unleashes all that power at once.

200
00:12:39,880 --> 00:13:00,040
!

201
00:13:00,040 --> 00:13:03,100
This high heel is made of
steel and weighs 100 kilos.

202
00:13:03,500 --> 00:13:05,600
Add to that the speed
of the waterfall's fall,

203
00:13:05,600 --> 00:13:08,660
and it can punch a hole
through any metal in one blow.

204
00:13:12,600 --> 00:13:15,620
On top of that, he's hidden by
the water pouring down the falls,

205
00:13:15,620 --> 00:13:18,560
so you can't predict where
he'll come flying out from.

206
00:13:42,040 --> 00:13:44,560
Anyone who takes that head-on
must be out of their mind!

207
00:13:46,100 --> 00:13:46,840
I won't lose!

208
00:13:50,940 --> 00:13:51,960
Hyaah!

209
00:13:52,420 --> 00:13:54,020
Your Majesty, now's our chance!

210
00:13:54,220 --> 00:13:57,620
You have to create a flight path through
the parts of the body humans can never train!

211
00:13:58,700 --> 00:14:00,240
Take this, deadly technique!

212
00:14:01,160 --> 00:14:02,220
Monotone Sword!

213
00:14:10,880 --> 00:14:13,980
He's already sunk to the deepest
part of the waterfall pool!

214
00:14:14,460 --> 00:14:19,460
Just as expected of the King, a brilliant play,
reading the game many moves ahead.

215
00:14:19,460 --> 00:14:25,180
He was wearing 100-kilogram high heels.
He might never float back up again.

216
00:14:30,840 --> 00:14:32,940
Even the Adventure King has been defeated?

217
00:14:39,200 --> 00:14:40,687
If we get through this grassland,

218
00:14:40,737 --> 00:14:44,580
all that's left is the
sheer cliff up to Ahondara-dō.

219
00:14:45,280 --> 00:14:47,760
I've been waiting for you, Kankichi Ryotsu.

220
00:14:49,220 --> 00:14:50,170
Heh heh heh.

221
00:14:50,220 --> 00:14:53,420
Don't be too shocked when you hear my name.

222
00:14:53,720 --> 00:14:55,900
Though I suppose you
can more or less guess it.

223
00:14:56,560 --> 00:14:59,022
I am one of the Hondaras Emperors,

224
00:14:59,072 --> 00:15:00,900
Triple Crown Dokaben!

225
00:15:01,780 --> 00:15:04,640
Just as I thought! Enough talk, come at me!

226
00:15:05,000 --> 00:15:08,300
Let me show you my finishing move, Yakyūken.

227
00:15:14,020 --> 00:15:15,480
Not bad.

228
00:15:15,480 --> 00:15:18,000
But this is only just beginning.

229
00:15:23,080 --> 00:15:24,580
Ryo-sama!

230
00:15:27,240 --> 00:15:28,440
How about it?

231
00:15:28,440 --> 00:15:30,480
Ryo-sama, get up!

232
00:15:30,480 --> 00:15:33,800
Please, stand up for Maria!

233
00:15:34,200 --> 00:15:37,680
Damn you, you son of a bitch!

234
00:15:37,680 --> 00:15:40,580
Not yet, not the finishing blow!

235
00:15:41,160 --> 00:15:42,620
Thirty rapid sword strikes!

236
00:15:55,320 --> 00:15:57,080
Damn it!

237
00:16:00,360 --> 00:16:01,500
This is the end!

238
00:16:08,440 --> 00:16:10,640
I won't let you bully Ryo-sama any more!

239
00:16:11,120 --> 00:16:12,760
Ryo-sama, now's your chance!

240
00:16:12,900 --> 00:16:17,240
We're creating a weak point in a part
of the body that no human can ever train!

241
00:16:18,000 --> 00:16:19,500
Sorry, Maria!

242
00:16:20,160 --> 00:16:21,760
Take this, finishing blow!

243
00:16:22,720 --> 00:16:23,880
Emotion source!

244
00:16:25,080 --> 00:16:26,420
Take that!

245
00:16:35,860 --> 00:16:37,880
Once again, love has won!

246
00:16:37,880 --> 00:16:39,940
This is it, the battle is decided!

247
00:16:39,940 --> 00:16:43,160
We can become the ideal couple!

248
00:16:43,160 --> 00:16:44,980
Hurry up, Maria!

249
00:16:47,920 --> 00:16:49,200
N-now, finally...

250
00:16:49,640 --> 00:16:53,120
So the last one remaining is the one
the Four Heavenly Kings had in mind?

251
00:16:57,680 --> 00:17:00,340
My model, my model!

252
00:17:02,100 --> 00:17:28,620
Noooooooooooooooooooooo! It's for the model!

253
00:17:28,620 --> 00:17:36,940
Then anything goes! Of course, I'll prepare
a room just for Ryo-san's models too. My pla -

254
00:17:36,940 --> 00:17:38,960
Eeeeeeeh?

255
00:17:41,660 --> 00:17:46,040
Maria! I've been waiting for you!
Let's go, Kankichi!

256
00:17:46,700 --> 00:17:52,960
That's the one called the strongest of the Four Heavenly Kings,
the Hundred Beasts' Ryan Malder!

257
00:17:59,600 --> 00:18:00,600
Just like this.

258
00:18:00,600 --> 00:18:02,380
Maria, are you all right?

259
00:18:02,380 --> 00:18:04,120
Yeah, Maria has

260
00:18:04,120 --> 00:18:06,560
the power of Ryo-sama's love!

261
00:18:06,560 --> 00:18:08,920
What's wrong, Ryo, Encyclopedia Knight?

262
00:18:08,920 --> 00:18:09,980
Come at me!

263
00:18:09,980 --> 00:18:13,220
Alright, here it comes!
Deadly Electric Kandal!

264
00:18:14,640 --> 00:18:18,500
Hmph, what is that supposed to be?

265
00:18:18,500 --> 00:18:23,340
Here I go! My special technique,
the Burning Sōkon Sword!

266
00:18:24,360 --> 00:18:26,260
It's going to get crushed!

267
00:18:30,320 --> 00:18:33,940
Here I come!

268
00:18:38,260 --> 00:18:44,260
Ryo-sama!

269
00:18:58,620 --> 00:19:12,120
Uuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuu

270
00:19:12,120 --> 00:19:14,060
This is the last one, Ryotsu!

271
00:19:22,660 --> 00:19:25,260
Deadly Birth Sword!

272
00:19:36,340 --> 00:19:38,660
Zondara Sword Ultimate Technique

273
00:19:38,660 --> 00:19:40,700
Deadly Blood, White Dove

274
00:19:42,120 --> 00:19:43,480
I can't escape the conditions!

275
00:19:44,880 --> 00:19:48,040
Here I come, Burning Fighting Spirit Sword!

276
00:19:53,220 --> 00:19:54,280
Ryo-sama!

277
00:19:56,580 --> 00:19:58,060
Ryo-sama!

278
00:19:58,900 --> 00:20:03,300
Ryo-sama!

279
00:20:06,980 --> 00:20:08,200
Go for it, Maria!

280
00:20:08,200 --> 00:20:13,920
Yaaah! Deadly Nabare-Style Birth Game!

281
00:20:24,780 --> 00:20:26,220
W-we won!

282
00:20:26,920 --> 00:20:29,240
It's the power of love after all!

283
00:20:29,560 --> 00:20:31,700
Y-you've made it this far.

284
00:20:31,700 --> 00:20:33,220
Kankichi Ryotsu

285
00:20:33,900 --> 00:20:35,420
My final opponent is

286
00:20:37,000 --> 00:20:37,920
me!

287
00:20:39,480 --> 00:20:41,920
Hey, that's a model kit you're hiding behind your back,
isn't it?

288
00:20:44,220 --> 00:20:45,480
Father.

289
00:20:48,400 --> 00:20:50,300
Hey, my model kit...

290
00:20:50,300 --> 00:20:54,040
Wait, Ryotsu. I have a favor to ask of you.

291
00:20:54,040 --> 00:20:54,880
What is it?

292
00:20:55,600 --> 00:20:59,560
I want you to inherit my
collection of model kits.

293
00:21:00,080 --> 00:21:00,680
No way.

294
00:21:00,680 --> 00:21:02,260
At least think about it a little!

295
00:21:02,920 --> 00:21:04,640
What's all this of a sudden?

296
00:21:05,720 --> 00:21:07,292
Maria,

297
00:21:07,342 --> 00:21:11,560
my time is running out.

298
00:21:11,560 --> 00:21:13,600
What? No...

299
00:21:14,240 --> 00:21:17,580
Don't grieve. This is simply fate.

300
00:21:20,240 --> 00:21:22,920
Hey, just hand over that model kit already.

301
00:21:25,260 --> 00:21:27,320
It can't be helped.

302
00:21:28,280 --> 00:21:30,380
There, there. Come now.

303
00:21:30,380 --> 00:21:31,240
Uuugh...

304
00:21:31,740 --> 00:21:33,600
R-Ryotsu Kankichi...

305
00:21:33,600 --> 00:21:36,580
You, the heir of my clan,

306
00:21:36,580 --> 00:21:39,660
I acknowledge as my rightful successor,

307
00:21:39,660 --> 00:21:42,580
and bestow upon you this secret poem.

308
00:21:43,260 --> 00:21:45,580
It's a model kit! Give back my model kit!

309
00:21:48,120 --> 00:21:48,920
What's wrong?

310
00:21:48,920 --> 00:21:50,100
Ouch!

311
00:21:50,100 --> 00:21:51,000
Waaaaaah!

312
00:21:54,780 --> 00:21:55,940
Father!

313
00:21:55,940 --> 00:21:58,160
Waaaaaah ow!

314
00:22:00,380 --> 00:22:19,120
Aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaah!

315
00:22:19,120 --> 00:22:22,280
Just as I expected of you.
You're the man I had my eye on.

316
00:22:25,480 --> 00:22:29,240
Please, t-take care of my collection!

317
00:22:30,420 --> 00:22:31,600
Father!

318
00:22:32,580 --> 00:22:34,860
Maria is, Maria is...

319
00:22:34,910 --> 00:22:37,240
I'll be happy with my parents.

320
00:22:37,240 --> 00:22:40,080
Please watch over me from heaven.

321
00:22:45,480 --> 00:22:46,520
What is this?

322
00:22:48,420 --> 00:22:48,900
A needle?

323
00:22:49,580 --> 00:22:50,060
What?

324
00:22:51,300 --> 00:22:53,080
Hm? Hm?

325
00:22:53,200 --> 00:22:56,680
That stabbing pain is gone.

326
00:22:56,680 --> 00:23:00,300
Was it just this needle pricking me?

327
00:23:00,620 --> 00:23:01,600
I see!

328
00:23:01,960 --> 00:23:05,160
When I sewed up the tear
in my dogi the other day,

329
00:23:05,160 --> 00:23:06,360
Ahahaha!

330
00:23:07,580 --> 00:23:08,700
Trey-chan!

331
00:23:09,240 --> 00:23:12,640
I see, so that's how it was.

332
00:23:12,640 --> 00:23:14,700
I'm fine, fine, completely fine!

333
00:23:16,520 --> 00:23:17,040
I'm fine!

334
00:23:17,220 --> 00:23:20,860
No, wait! My model kit, aaaaah!

335
00:23:21,740 --> 00:23:23,027
My model kit...

336
00:23:23,077 --> 00:23:26,020
Is that my model kit?!

337
00:23:27,280 --> 00:23:28,140
I'm fine!

338
00:23:28,940 --> 00:23:32,320
With the power of your love,
it's a happy ending!

339
00:23:32,420 --> 00:23:33,880
We did it!

340
00:23:34,100 --> 00:23:36,940
Saved! My model kit!

341
00:24:01,000 --> 00:24:04,520
Sandals any time, scandals any time,
I don't care about it.

342
00:24:05,300 --> 00:24:08,360
Playing cool every day.

343
00:24:08,360 --> 00:24:13,900
Boredom? I crumpled it into a
reprimand letter and tossed it away.

344
00:24:15,000 --> 00:24:18,420
Bare instincts, naked instincts, going wild.

345
00:24:19,440 --> 00:24:22,200
Reckless and broke, so what?

346
00:24:23,840 --> 00:24:27,920
My way, doing whatever I want,
that's all there is.

347
00:24:54,660 --> 00:24:57,860
Thanks for watching!

348
00:24:57,920 --> 00:25:01,020
Bura-kōchi, paiko paiko paiko no Shūringan

349
00:25:01,020 --> 00:25:03,000
Shūringan no Gūrindai

350
00:25:03,000 --> 00:25:06,200
Gūrindai no Poppo Kokkii no Poppo Kōnā no

351
00:25:06,200 --> 00:25:07,800
Chō-kyūmei no Chōsuke

352
00:25:15,220 --> 00:25:16,500
I caught a tuna!

353
00:25:16,960 --> 00:25:19,400
And it's a big one, worth five million yen!

354
00:25:19,400 --> 00:25:21,620
If I keep reeling them in at this rate,

355
00:25:22,740 --> 00:25:24,000
Come on, tuna!

356
00:25:24,000 --> 00:25:26,580
This man of the sea, Kankichi Ryotsu-sama!

357
00:25:28,540 --> 00:25:32,140
Next time:
"The Cop Riding a Tuna." See you then!

